=== §2 corrections (harness bugs, not contract bugs) — re-run after fixing lib.sh ===
Root cause 1: build_invoice_json printed 2 lines (path + ref hash); `| tail -1` grabbed the wrong one. Fixed: function now prints only the file path.
Root cause 2: DUMMY_SIG was hand-typed with an odd hex-digit count (131 chars instead of 130). Fixed: generated programmatically, verified length.
Root cause 3: REG-24 used `cast call`, whose revert output doesn't decode custom error names to text (unlike `cast send`'s gas-estimation path) — only the raw selector. Verified 0x20bb2818 == InvoiceNotFound(bytes32) via `cast sig` before relying on it.
