=== SET-18 correction ===
Root cause: original SET-18 cycle used [extinguished-AB, D->E, E->D] which isn't a valid path
at all (B != D), so it hit PathBroken before ever reaching the InvoiceNotActive check it meant
to test -- a harness construction bug, masked because PathBroken is also a revert (test framework
initially reported it as a plain FAIL against the wrong error name, correctly). Also hit a second
harness bug on the fix attempt: recomputing MAT as "now+30d" in a later debug session drifts from
the actual registered value since real time elapses between script runs -- had to use the exact
logged maturity (1792307634) from SET-17's own getInvoice readback instead of re-deriving it.
Fixed by routing the new cycle legs through the extinguished invoice's actual creditor (B) and
back to its actual debtor (A): [extinguished A->B, fresh B->D, fresh D->A].
