=== RACE-05b correction (harness check gap, not a contract bug) ===
settle() referencing the concurrently-registering invoice failed at gas-ESTIMATION time
("Failed to estimate gas ... InvoiceNotFound") -- meaning it never even reached the mempool as a
broadcast transaction, so there was no receipt/status field for my check to find. This is actually
the cleanest possible confirmation of RACE-05's intent (no unsafe optimistic read of pending
state) -- better than a mined-then-reverted tx, since it means Arc's RPC node's own simulation
correctly saw the invoice didn't exist yet at request time. Fixed the check to also accept this
shape; confirmed the follow-up resubmission (same call, after register(H->I) confirmed) succeeds.
